            <div xml:id="d515">

                <pb facs="0502" n="490" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg490"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.24591/6a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-05-21T18:00:00-04:00">May 21, 1943—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>250. Iranian Minister here has been instructed to take up with Department
                    question of relations between American military authorities in southern Iran and
                    local Iranian officials. As we understand it, Iranian Government complains that
                    American officers give orders direct to Iranian officials instead of taking up
                    matters through proper channels.</p>
                <p>Minister states this question has been discussed with you by Iranian Foreign
                    Office.</p>
                <p>Please let us have any information you have and report steps you may have taken
                    to resolve the difficulty.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
